      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "Hey all. I've noticed that there are a lot of question threads floating around - some of which haven't been answered and some of which haven't been given an official rulings post. In order to sort some stuff out and make answers a bit easier to find, I'm starting a thread to get any/all questions you could possibly have. As I get questions, I'll work on getting the answers for them and then make sure that they're put into the rulings board.\n\nSo, tl;dr, ask any rules questions you have starting...now!\n\n[b]THE QUESTIONS[/b]\nIs playing the top card of a hero deck is the same as a hero playing a card (it has been stated that putting a card into play from the trash or the deck is not the same as playing a card)?\n[color=red]Unanswered[/color]\n\nDoes the source of the action of playing a card matter (such as when a card from an environment or villain deck says to \"put the top card of the hero decks into play\")?\n[color=red]Unanswered[/color]",
